<title>UK: Siebe H1 pretax profit jumps 32 percent.</title>
<headline>Siebe H1 pretax profit jumps 32 percent.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Sept 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		24.0		   vs 19.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 4.9		    vs 4.44</p>
<p> Pretax		     190.4		  vs 144.2</p>
<p> Turnover		   1,471		  vs 1,200</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 177 and 195 million stg and an interim dividend of 4.8 to 4.9 pence a share.</p>
<p>Full company name - Siebe Plc.</p>
</text>
